    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanheart City</strong> is a small nation located in the northern part of the continent. Once renowned for its abundant resources and ancient ruins scattered throughout the land, it now lies in decline following a devastating beast invasion years ago. Though the flames of war have since been extinguished, the once-glorious nation is quietly fading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a young alchemist, will open a potion shop here, welcoming guests from all walks of life\u2014adventurers, nobles, and local citizens. Each carries their own story, and through your interactions with them, you will gradually piece together the truth behind Sanheart City's downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a narrative-driven simulation game where you must craft potions tailored to each customer's needs, fulfilling their expectations. With every choice and every successful brew, your shop will grow and become an essential part of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich original story unveiling the secrets of a fantasy world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of collectible and researchable plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flexible potion crafting system allowing unique combinations and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous alchemical recipes and experiments offering strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel graphics</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanheart City</strong> is a small nation located in the northern part of the continent. Once renowned for its abundant resources and ancient ruins scattered throughout the land, it now lies in decline following a devastating beast invasion years ago. Though the flames of war have since been extinguished, the once-glorious nation is quietly fading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a young alchemist, will open a potion shop here, welcoming guests from all walks of life\u2014adventurers, nobles, and local citizens. Each carries their own story, and through your interactions with them, you will gradually piece together the truth behind Sanheart City's downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a narrative-driven simulation game where you must craft potions tailored to each customer's needs, fulfilling their expectations. With every choice and every successful brew, your shop will grow and become an essential part of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich original story unveiling the secrets of a fantasy world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of collectible and researchable plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flexible potion crafting system allowing unique combinations and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous alchemical recipes and experiments offering strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel graphics</p></li></ul>",
